{%- comment -%}
  The data a card's "Add to bag" label carries, so the bag drawer
  (assets/sj-cart.js) can add the piece without opening it: the first variant
  that can be bought, the handle, and data-multi when the piece has sizes or
  colours to choose from (the drawer asks for them first). A piece that cannot
  be bought gets nothing, and its label simply opens the product.
  Accepts: product.
{%- endcomment -%}
{%- if product.available %} data-variant="{{ product.selected_or_first_available_variant.id }}" data-handle="{{ product.handle }}"{% unless product.has_only_default_variant %} data-multi{% endunless %}{% endif -%}
